sub:assertion {
<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/claim/levin-2024-anthrobots-25> a <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/Claim>;
    dc:description "Anthrobots fuse into larger superbots only in the days immediately after release from the matrix, while their basal layers are still exposed and can mediate bot-to-bot fusion, and superbot size can be controlled by the number of Anthrobots cultured together in a well.";
    dc:type "mechanism";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Superbot size is set by bot number and fusion requires exposed basal layers";
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/context> "Gumuskaya G, Srivastava P, Cooper BG, Lesser H, Semegran B, Garnier S, Levin M, “Motile Living Biobots Self-Construct from Adult Human Somatic Progenitor Seed Cells”, Advanced science (Weinheim, Baden-Wurttemberg, Germany) (2024), doi:10.1002/advs.202303575; section “Discussion”. Scope: NHBE-derived Anthrobots in the days after matrix dissolution"
}
